.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK ATTACHMENT VIEW"
.SH NAME
hamstik work attachment view \- Preview an image attachment inline on a capable terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work attachment view [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Preview an image attachment inline on a capable terminal
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.TP
.I ATTACHMENT_ID
Attachment id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -o, --output
Output path used when inline preview is unavailable (defaults to the attachment's file name in the current directory)
